{
  "about": "What the release's programs carry beside jukecord, from each project's own releases: Node.js (the SHA-256 from the release's SHASUMS256.txt, signed by the Node.js release team), yt-dlp (from the release's SHA2-256SUMS, the same release and sums as the image's in deploy/docker/Dockerfile) and, for Linux, libatomic, which Node.js needs and a bare system may lack (Debian's package, from its lasting snapshot archive, whose list gives each file's SHA-1; the SHA-256 is of that file). FFmpeg's release is the image's; the libraries it is built with are in deploy/bundle/ffmpeg.sh. node scripts/pins.ts node <version> and node scripts/pins.ts yt-dlp <version> move those two; libatomic moves by hand (CONTRIBUTING.md).",
